This repository contains a LoRA adapter for Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct. It does
not contain the base model weights. The adapter was trained by Marc C. Deller
as part of the BINMAN project (https://github.com/bellcheddar/BINMAN) and is a
modification within the meaning of section 3 of that Agreement.

Modifications, stated as section 3(b) requires:

  * LoRA factors of rank 8 were trained over 16 layers of the base model,
    targeting q_proj, k_proj, v_proj, o_proj, gate_proj, up_proj and down_proj.
    The base model weights themselves are unchanged and are not redistributed
    here.
  * The adapter was trained with mlx-lm against the 4-bit quantisation
    mlx-community/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct-4bit, then converted to PEFT layout by
    lm/export_hf.py in the BINMAN repository. The conversion transposes both
    LoRA factors and restates the MLX scale as PEFT's lora_alpha.

Use is NON-COMMERCIAL ONLY, as section 2(a) of the Agreement requires.
